Package: com.ps16.photographicstyles16
Name: PhotographicStyles16
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: iPhone 16 Photographic Styles inside the stock Camera app on iPhone 5s (iOS 12.5.8). Five presets (Standard, Pearl, Rose Gold, Contrast, Amber), an 11x11 dot-matrix tone/colour pad, a live GPU viewfinder preview and full-resolution capture baking with a single shared Metal-backed CIContext.
Maintainer: PS16 Developer <dev@ps16.local>
Author: PS16 Developer <dev@ps16.local>
Section: Tweaks
Depends: firmware (>= 12.0), mobilesubstrate
